msgid "MailCraft will make one appointment called \"MailCraft connection check\" in the calendar of {account}, a year from today. It reads it back, changes its time twice (the second time said in this computer's time zone), reads it back each time, and deletes it again. Nothing else in your calendar is read or changed, nobody is invited or written to, and no reminder is set. Afterwards you see what the server answered at each step, and whether what was sent is what the server has."
